{"seq":3,"slug":"content-brief-deliverable","title":"内容 brief 与交付物约定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-influencer-kol-marketing-platform/outreach-brief-contract/content-brief-deliverable","wordCount":2106,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"内容-brief-与交付物约定\">内容 brief 与交付物约定</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>合同写清了「给多少钱、要几条、能用在哪」，但没有写「拍成什么样」。达人不懂品牌的营销话术，品牌也不懂达人所在平台的内容语感；如果直接把合同丢给达人让他自由发挥，结果通常两败俱伤：达人交出流量很好但完全没提到产品卖点的内容，或者交出照本宣科、毫无原生感、被粉丝一眼看穿是广告的内容。内容 brief 就是这两者之间的翻译层。</p>\n<p>一份好的 brief 是<strong>约束与自由的精确切分</strong>。它必须明确哪些是不可协商的（必须出现的产品、必须传达的核心信息、必须有的披露标记），哪些是留给达人的创作空间（叙事方式、镜头语言、音乐、节奏）。切分错了会出两类问题：约束太松，内容不可用于营销；约束太紧，内容失去达人的个人风格，粉丝不买账，投放效果反而更差。</p>\n<p>brief 与交付物约定是同一件事的两个面：brief 是「要什么」，交付物约定是「怎么算完成」。后者是第 3 章审核环节的验收清单来源——没有它，审核就只能靠主观判断，也无法回答「达人少交了一条该不该扣款」。</p>\n<p>本流程的输入是 <a href=\"sample-seeding-contract\">寄样与合同/合规条款</a> 中结构化落库的契约字段（<code>deliverable_count</code>、<code>revision_rounds</code>、<code>exclusivity_days</code>、<code>usage_rights</code>），输出是一份达人可执行、系统可验收的 brief，交给第 3 章 <a href=\"../content-review-rights/creator-content-review\">达人内容审核与合规</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[合同条款] --&gt; B[Brief 生成]&#10;  B --&gt; C{必选要素}&#10;  B --&gt; D{创作自由区}&#10;  C --&gt; E[卖点/产品/披露]&#10;  D --&gt; F[叙事/风格/节奏]&#10;  E --&gt; G[交付物约定]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[达人执行]&#10;  H --&gt; I[提交审核]&#10;  I --&gt;|不通过| J[返工 ≤ revision_rounds]&#10;  J --&gt; H&#10;  I --&gt;|通过| K[验收]\">graph TD\n  A[合同条款] --&gt; B[Brief 生成]\n  B --&gt; C{必选要素}\n  B --&gt; D{创作自由区}\n  C --&gt; E[卖点/产品/披露]\n  D --&gt; F[叙事/风格/节奏]\n  E --&gt; G[交付物约定]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[达人执行]\n  H --&gt; I[提交审核]\n  I --&gt;|不通过| J[返工 ≤ revision_rounds]\n  J --&gt; H\n  I --&gt;|通过| K[验收]</pre><h2 id=\"brief-的结构化要素\">brief 的结构化要素</h2><h3 id=\"三层信息结构\">三层信息结构</h3><p>一份可执行的 brief 由三层信息构成，从硬到软依次是：合规约束层（不可协商）、内容要求层（可协商但需达成）、创作建议层（参考性质）。</p>\n<p>合规约束层里最不能含糊的是披露。它不是品牌的美化项而是法定要求，且判定标准比多数人以为的宽——FTC 明确把无财务价值的激励（如抽奖参与机会）、朋友或家人的关系、以及跨平台的持续性付费关系都算作需要披露的「实质联系」，并要求披露「清晰而显著」、越接近推荐本身越好（依据见 <a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/ftcs-endorsement-guides-what-people-are-asking\">FTC 代言披露问答</a>，第 3 章 <a href=\"../content-review-rights/disclosure-ad-compliance\">广告披露与平台合规标识</a> 会展开平台差异）。因此在 brief 里把披露写成 <code>mandatory.disclosure</code> 的结构化字段而非一句提醒，是这份文档能否被自动校验的前提。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>约束强度</th>\n<th>校验方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>合规约束</td>\n<td>披露标记、品类限制、禁用表述</td>\n<td>强制，违反即拒</td>\n<td>规则自动校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容要求</td>\n<td>必提卖点、必现产品、时长区间</td>\n<td>需达成，偏离需说明</td>\n<td>校验 + 人工</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>创作建议</td>\n<td>叙事框架、参考案例、风格倾向</td>\n<td>参考</td>\n<td>不校验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把三层混在一段文字里是 brief 最常见的失败模式。达人读到「要提到续航 20 小时，可以像上次那样开场」时无法判断「像上次那样开场」是要求还是建议，审核时双方也无法对齐。结构化的做法是让三层在数据模型里分开，强制层由系统校验，建议层明确标注为参考。</p>\n<h3 id=\"卖点表达的表达范式\">卖点表达的表达范式</h3><p>品牌通常用抽象的营销语言描述卖点（「极致续航体验」），达人无法直接使用。brief 应当把每个卖点转成<strong>达人可自然说出口的表达范式</strong>。</p>\n<p>一个实用的转换方法是「事实 → 场景 → 可说的话」三段式。例如事实是「电池容量 20000mAh，支持 65W 快充」，场景是「机场转机两小时，手机从 5% 充到 80%」，可说的话是「我上次在希思罗转机，两小时把手机从快没电充到八成」。达人可以直接使用第三段，且它天然比品牌话术可信。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;brief_id&quot;: &quot;B-2026-0912-01&quot;,&#10;  &quot;campaign_id&quot;: &quot;C-2026-0912&quot;,&#10;  &quot;creator_id&quot;: 88421,&#10;  &quot;mandatory&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;disclosure&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;labels&quot;: [&quot;#ad&quot;, &quot;Paid partnership&quot;],&#10;      &quot;placement&quot;: &quot;superimposed_text_on_video_start&quot;,&#10;      &quot;also_in_caption&quot;: true&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;product_must_appear&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;blocked_terms&quot;: [&quot;cure&quot;, &quot;guaranteed results&quot;, &quot;best in the world&quot;],&#10;    &quot;min_duration_sec&quot;: 25,&#10;    &quot;max_duration_sec&quot;: 75&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;talking_points&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;fact&quot;: &quot;20000mAh, 65W fast charge&quot;,&#10;      &quot;scene&quot;: &quot;airport layover, phone low battery&quot;,&#10;      &quot;sayable&quot;: &quot;charged my phone from nearly dead to 80% in a two-hour layover&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;fact&quot;: &quot;two USB-C ports plus USB-A&quot;,&#10;      &quot;scene&quot;: &quot;charging laptop and phone together&quot;,&#10;      &quot;sayable&quot;: &quot;it ran my laptop and my phone at the same time&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;creative_freedom&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;narrative&quot;: &quot;any&quot;,&#10;    &quot;music&quot;: &quot;creator_choice&quot;,&#10;    &quot;reference_links&quot;: [&quot;https://example.com/ref-1&quot;],&#10;    &quot;note&quot;: &quot;keep your usual intro style&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"brief_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B-2026-0912-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"campaign_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"C-2026-0912\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"creator_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">88421</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"mandatory\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"disclosure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"labels\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#ad\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Paid partnership\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"placement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"superimposed_text_on_video_start\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"also_in_caption\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"product_must_appear\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"blocked_terms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"guaranteed results\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"best in the world\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"min_duration_sec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"max_duration_sec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">75</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"talking_points\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"fact\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"20000mAh, 65W fast charge\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"scene\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"airport layover, phone low battery\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"sayable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"charged my phone from nearly dead to 80% in a two-hour layover\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"fact\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"two USB-C ports plus USB-A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"scene\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"charging laptop and phone together\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"sayable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"it ran my laptop and my phone at the same time\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"creative_freedom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"narrative\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"any\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"music\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"creator_choice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reference_links\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://example.com/ref-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"keep your usual intro style\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>min_duration_sec</code> 与 <code>max_duration_sec</code> 是短内容品类的实际约束：太短无法承载卖点，太长会被平台截断或降低完播率。这个区间应当按平台分别设定，因为各平台的最佳时长差异明显。</p>\n<h2 id=\"交付物约定的建模\">交付物约定的建模</h2><h3 id=\"交付物的类型与数量\">交付物的类型与数量</h3><p>「交付 2 条内容」这个约定必须细化，否则验收无从下手。完整的交付物定义包含类型、数量、平台、形式与时限。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>deliverable_type</code></td>\n<td>内容类型</td>\n<td>short_video / static_post / story / long_video</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>platform</code></td>\n<td>发布平台</td>\n<td>tiktok / instagram / youtube</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>count</code></td>\n<td>条数</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>due_at</code></td>\n<td>交付截止（达人当地时间）</td>\n<td>2026-10-15T18:00+02:00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>publish_window_days</code></td>\n<td>允许发布的时间窗口</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>asset_required</code></td>\n<td>是否需回传原始素材</td>\n<td>true</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>asset_required</code> 值得特别注意。品牌做二次投放时，往往需要未经平台压缩的原始视频文件与可编辑版本，而不仅仅是发布后的链接。这项要求必须在约定阶段写明——事后索要原始素材，达人多半已经删除，且没有义务提供。</p>\n<h3 id=\"修改轮数与返工规则\">修改轮数与返工规则</h3><p><code>revision_rounds</code>（合同已约定）定义了允许的返工次数。工程上需要一套与它配合的规则，否则会出现无限返工。</p>\n<p>基线规则是：每轮返工必须给出<strong>结构化的修改项</strong>（哪一条必提卖点缺失、哪个禁用词出现），而不是主观评价（「感觉不够好」）；返工请求必须在提交后 48 小时内发出，超时视为通过；超出约定轮数的修改需要额外付费或双方协商。这些规则既保护达人（避免被无限要求修改），也保护品牌（避免被迫接受不合规内容）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"提交流程与验收判定\">提交流程与验收判定</h2><h3 id=\"提交与状态流转\">提交与状态流转</h3><p>达人提交内容后进入审核队列，状态机如下：<code>pending_submission</code> → <code>submitted</code> → <code>under_review</code> → <code>approved</code> / <code>revision_requested</code> → <code>published</code> → <code>verified_live</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE deliverable (&#10;  deliverable_id   BIGINT PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT,&#10;  contract_id      BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  creator_id       BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  deliverable_type VARCHAR(24) NOT NULL,&#10;  platform         VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,&#10;  seq              INT NOT NULL,            -- 第几条（1..count）&#10;  due_at           TIMESTAMP NOT NULL,&#10;  status           VARCHAR(24) NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;pending_submission&#39;,&#10;  submitted_at     TIMESTAMP,&#10;  approved_at      TIMESTAMP,&#10;  published_url    VARCHAR(512),&#10;  live_verified_at TIMESTAMP,&#10;  revision_count   INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  asset_url        VARCHAR(512),&#10;  UNIQUE KEY uk_contract_seq (contract_id, seq),&#10;  KEY idx_status_due (status, due_at)&#10;) COMMENT &#39;交付物：验收的最小单位&#39;;&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE brief_check_result (&#10;  check_id       BIGINT PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT,&#10;  deliverable_id BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  rule_code      VARCHAR(48) NOT NULL,      -- missing_disclosure|blocked_term|...&#10;  severity       VARCHAR(8)  NOT NULL,      -- block | warn&#10;  evidence       VARCHAR(512),&#10;  checked_at     TIMESTAMP NOT NULL,&#10;  KEY idx_deliverable (deliverable_id)&#10;) COMMENT &#39;brief 规则校验结果：返工请求的依据&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deliverable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  deliverable_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AUTO_INCREMENT,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  contract_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  creator_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  deliverable_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  platform         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  seq              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 第几条（1..count）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  due_at           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending_submission'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  submitted_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  approved_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  published_url    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  live_verified_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  revision_count   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  asset_url        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uk_contract_seq (contract_id, seq),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_status_due (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, due_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) COMMENT </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'交付物：验收的最小单位'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> brief_check_result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  check_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AUTO_INCREMENT,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  deliverable_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_code      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">48</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- missing_disclosure|blocked_term|...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  severity       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- block | warn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  checked_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_deliverable (deliverable_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) COMMENT </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'brief 规则校验结果：返工请求的依据'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>uk_contract_seq</code> 保证「第 2 条」这个身份在合同内唯一，避免重复提交或漏交时统计混乱。<code>brief_check_result</code> 表的存在让返工请求可以引用具体的规则命中项，而不是一段主观评价——这直接提高了达人的配合度，因为他知道要改什么。</p>\n<h3 id=\"自动校验能覆盖什么\">自动校验能覆盖什么</h3><p>发布前能自动校验的规则包括：披露标记是否存在（文本层面）、禁用词是否出现、时长是否在区间内、产品是否在画面中出现（需视觉检测，可靠性中等）。<strong>不能</strong>可靠自动校验的是「卖点是否被自然传达」——这需要语义判断，误判率高。</p>\n<p>因此验收判定应当分级：<code>block</code> 级规则命中（无披露、出现禁用词、涉及禁用品类）直接拒绝；<code>warn</code> 级命中（时长略超、未检测到产品）进入人工复核。这个分级让自动化承担它擅长的部分，把语义判断留给审核员。</p>\n<h3 id=\"逾期与未交付\">逾期与未交付</h3><p>不是所有交付都会发生。逾期未提交需要处理：宽限期内提醒、超宽限期触发违约判定、并通知第 4 章结算侧。违约的处置方式（扣减坑位费、取消合作、列入观察名单）由合同约定，系统负责的是<strong>准确记录事实</strong>（应交付数、实交付数、逾期天数）并把事实传递给结算。</p>\n<p>第 4 章 <a href=\"../campaign-performance-settle/creator-fee-commission-settle\">坑位费/佣金结算</a> 会用到这里的 <code>deliverable</code> 表做「已交付才可结算」的前置校验——这是把「验收」与「付款」解耦又保持关联的关键设计：验收在内容侧完成，付款在结算侧依据验收结果执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>brief 是约束与自由的精确切分，三层结构（合规约束/内容要求/创作建议）必须在数据模型里分开。</li>\n<li>卖点要用「事实 → 场景 → 可说的话」转成达人可直接使用的表达，而非品牌话术。</li>\n<li>交付物定义必须细化到类型、平台、条数、截止、是否回传原始素材。</li>\n<li>原始素材（未压缩）必须在约定阶段就要求，事后索要多半无效。</li>\n<li>返工必须给结构化修改项，返工请求有时限，超轮数需协商。</li>\n<li>校验分级：<code>block</code> 级自动拒绝，<code>warn</code> 级转人工；语义判断不交给自动化。</li>\n<li>逾期违约的判定由合同约定，系统只负责准确记录事实并传给结算侧。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>brief 交付后进入第 3 章：<a href=\"../content-review-rights/creator-content-review\">达人内容审核与合规</a> 执行验收，<a href=\"../content-review-rights/disclosure-ad-compliance\">广告披露与平台合规标识</a> 深入处理披露这一强制项。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内容 brief 与交付物约定","id":"内容-brief-与交付物约定"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"brief 的结构化要素","id":"brief-的结构化要素"},{"level":3,"text":"三层信息结构","id":"三层信息结构"},{"level":3,"text":"卖点表达的表达范式","id":"卖点表达的表达范式"},{"level":2,"text":"交付物约定的建模","id":"交付物约定的建模"},{"level":3,"text":"交付物的类型与数量","id":"交付物的类型与数量"},{"level":3,"text":"修改轮数与返工规则","id":"修改轮数与返工规则"},{"level":2,"text":"提交流程与验收判定","id":"提交流程与验收判定"},{"level":3,"text":"提交与状态流转","id":"提交与状态流转"},{"level":3,"text":"自动校验能覆盖什么","id":"自动校验能覆盖什么"},{"level":3,"text":"逾期与未交付","id":"逾期与未交付"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"寄样与合同/合规条款","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-influencer-kol-marketing-platform/outreach-brief-contract/sample-seeding-contract"},"next":{"title":"达人内容审核与合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-influencer-kol-marketing-platform/content-review-rights/creator-content-review"}}